prop keeperbox obj.name=keeperbox
prop keeperbox if.open=signal|keepercode
prop keeperbox else.open=message||The keeper's strongbox. A keypad on the post beside it wants three numbers.
note keeperbox Keeper's strongbox | A keycard stamped CONCORD. Tag: FOR THE DOORS DOWN SOUTH.
loot keeperbox story:raft-Tangaroa_KeyCard*1;TitaniumOre*2;Battery*1;Nail*10
prop keeperbox loot.refill=0

# --- Deep (10-24, SL14 DEEP 1-HOUR PASS): the climb - a 36 m scaffold tower on its pad beside a raised peak, a plank
# bridge from landing 3 to the summit, the top locker, a stash on landing 2, a cairn and buried tin on the peak; the
# dive - a flooded pit with a wreck, an air bell, a chest and a sunk secret, a ramp out (lib_deep14)
call dp_ground tx=71 tz=-19 hb=5.2 sx=83.56 sz=-22.36 hs=26.8
