# --- end of jump course bs ---

note teolist Teo's packing list | TEO'S PACKING LIST - on the back of a tobacco label\n\nTo bring south: tobacco (all). The good knife (Hedda has it; ask nicely, then ask Ines). One radio, Ines's, do not touch, she will know. Rope, because Hedda says rope, always rope. Courage - forgot, borrow some from Hedda.\n\nTo leave behind: the keeper's hens. They watched me sleep. I do not trust a bird that blinks sideways. Also my bad knee, and the feeling that something on that tower watches the camp at night.\n\nInes thinks the keeper went south before us. Hedda thinks he went into the sea. I think he went somewhere with better tobacco. Loser cooks.
note planecrate Mail crate | Wet mail bags. One letter is addressed to the Command Well.
quest title=The Last Beacon
quest intro=A beacon still turning on a saddle between two stacks. Go up to it.
step reach|beacon|1|Go up to the beacon on the saddle
step read|Pilgrims' log|1|Read the pilgrims' log by the cold fires
step blueprint|Blueprint_Reciever|1|Take the Receiver and head light plans from the radio hut
step blueprint|Blueprint_HeadLight|1|Take the head light plans from the radio hut too
step blueprint|Blueprint_Antenna|1|Take the antenna and recycler plans from the beacon tower
step blueprint|Blueprint_Recycler|1|Take the recycler plans from the beacon tower too
step read|Bearing card|1|Read the bearing card pinned by the camp
step open|Cave chest|1|Find the pilgrims' chest in the west cave and read its lid
step read|Mail plane log|1|Read the log at the mail plane wreck on the east slope
step collect|story:letter|1|Take the keeper's undelivered letter from the mail crate
step read|Keeper's last page|1|Read the keeper's last page at the ruined house in the south
step open|Keeper's strongbox|1|Type the keeper's three numbers and open his strongbox
step reach|bs_dive|1|Dive to the caravan at the bottom of the pilgrims' cistern
step collect|story:bell|1|Take the pilgrims' bell from the caravan chest
step reach|bs_top|1|Climb the Old Light by the peak to its top
step open|Lightkeeper's locker|1|Open the lightkeeper's locker with the bell
step collect|story:pulse|1|Record the pulse off the radio set
quest done=The pulse is on your reel and the Receiver is yours to build. The next station answers about three kilometres on.
quest reward=Plank*10;Rope*4;Nail*10

save Beacon Saddle
